{
  "info": {
    "name": "GDB Citizen Loan Portal",
    "description": "Exercises the gdb_bank API through the frontend nginx proxy. Postman keeps the Frappe `sid` session cookie automatically — run a Login request first, everything after rides that session. Two ways in: email+password (Frappe's own login) and e-ID+password (Keycloak, realm gdb-citizen) — both end in the same sid session, so every request below works after either. Variables: baseUrl (default http://localhost:3000), password (default admin, the Frappe demo users), eidPassword (default ChangeMe@123, the Keycloak accounts).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "admin"
    },
    {
      "key": "eidPassword",
      "value": "ChangeMe@123"
    },
    {
      "key": "loanName",
      "value": "ACC-LOAP-2026-00001"
    },
    {
      "key": "documentName",
      "value": "GDB-DOC-2026-00001"
    },
    {
      "key": "requestName",
      "value": "GDB-REQ-2026-00001"
    },
    {
      "key": "memberEid",
      "value": "592-3333-0003"
    },
    {
      "key": "clusterName",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login — staff (underwriter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.staff_login",
            "description": "Keycloak password grant against the STAFF realm with the work email as the username, then the ordinary Frappe sid session. Never provisions: the Frappe account and its roles must already exist (created by the platform administrator). Roles come from Frappe, never Keycloak.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"underwriter@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"password\": \"{{eidPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — staff (disbursement officer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.staff_login",
            "description": "The persona that MOVES MONEY. Disbursement, the payment file and collections answer to this login and refuse the underwriter.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"finance@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"password\": \"{{eidPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — staff (finance officer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.staff_login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"financeofficer@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"password\": \"{{eidPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — staff (platform admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.staff_login",
            "description": "Accounts, roles, the kill switch, health and integration settings. Refused at every credit and money endpoint.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"password\": \"{{eidPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — staff, first sign-in (choose your own password)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.staff_set_password",
            "description": "For an account the admin just created or reset. `staff_login` with the one-time password answers `password_change_required: true` and opens no session; this swaps it for the person's own (≥12 characters, not the one-time password, not the email) and signs them in.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"k.ramdass@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"password\": \"<one-time password from Create / Reset>\",\n  \"new_password\": \"<a password only they know>\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — e-ID (citizen)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.password_login",
            "description": "Keycloak password grant with the e-ID as the username, then the ordinary Frappe sid session. 592-1111-0001 LINKS to the already-seeded citizen@example.gy — no duplicate account, so `provisioned` is false.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eid\": \"592-1111-0001\",\n  \"password\": \"{{eidPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — e-ID (provisions a new citizen)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.password_login",
            "description": "No Frappe user exists for this e-ID: the first sign-in provisions a Website User with the Citizen role and answers `provisioned: true`. Bare digits (33333333333) are normalised to the same thing.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eid\": \"592-3333-0003\",\n  \"password\": \"{{eidPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — e-ID onto a staff account — REFUSED",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.password_login",
            "description": "401 \"This e-ID belongs to a GDB staff account. GDB staff sign in with their work email.\" The citizen realm's 592-2222-0002 carries the underwriter's mailbox; the e-ID door never opens a staff account, and nothing is linked.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eid\": \"592-2222-0002\",\n  \"password\": \"{{eidPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — e-ID (wrong password)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.password_login",
            "description": "401 \"Incorrect e-ID or password.\" — deliberately the SAME answer an unknown e-ID gets, so the endpoint never reveals which e-IDs exist. Rate-limited to 8 attempts per e-ID per minute; the 9th is a 429.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eid\": \"592-1111-0001\",\n  \"password\": \"WrongPassword1!\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Frappe login — citizen — REFUSED",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/login",
            "description": "401 \"Citizens sign in with their e-ID.\" Frappe's own login stays for System Users only (the Administrator break-glass and the ERPNext desk).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usr\": \"citizen@example.gy\",\n  \"pwd\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Frappe login — Administrator (break-glass)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usr\": \"Administrator\",\n  \"pwd\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign-in doors available?",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.identity.eid_login_available",
            "description": "`available` / `citizen_realm` for the e-ID door, `staff_available` / `staff_realm` for the staff door.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Whoami",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.whoami",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/logout",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform Admin",
      "description": "Sign in first with \"Login — staff (platform admin)\". Every state change needs a reason and lands in the append-only access history. Every one of these answers 403 to any other role.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List staff accounts",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.list_users",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"kind\": \"staff\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List citizen accounts (search by e-ID)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.list_users",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"kind\": \"citizens\",\n  \"search\": \"592-1111\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "One account",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.get_user",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user\": \"underwriter@gdb.gov.gy\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create a staff account",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.create_staff_user",
            "description": "No Frappe password is set. With the Keycloak admin client configured, the staff-realm account is created with a TEMPORARY one-time password, returned once as `one_time_password` (stored and logged nowhere). The person signs in with it and must choose their own — see \"Login — staff, first sign-in\". `keycloak.status` says what happened.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Kevin Ramdass\",\n  \"email\": \"k.ramdass@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"eid\": \"592-4321-0099\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    \"Loan Underwriter\"\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"New hire, credit team\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set roles — REFUSED for System Manager",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.set_user_roles",
            "description": "403 — only Loan Underwriter, Disbursement Officer and Finance Officer are grantable.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user\": \"k.ramdass@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    \"System Manager\"\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"Test\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set roles (desired end state)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.set_user_roles",
            "description": "Repeating the same request answers `changed: false` and records nothing new.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user\": \"k.ramdass@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    \"Loan Underwriter\",\n    \"Disbursement Officer\"\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"Covering for leave, Oct\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Disable an account (kill switch)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.set_user_enabled",
            "description": "Ends the account's open sessions at once; every sign-in then refuses it, whatever Keycloak says.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user\": \"k.ramdass@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"enabled\": 0,\n  \"reason\": \"Resigned 30 Sep 2026\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password (one-time password, shown once)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.reset_password",
            "description": "Replaces whatever the account signs in with by a new one-time password (`one_time_password`, this response only) and ends its open sessions. Do not aim it at a seeded persona: their ChangeMe@123 stops working.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user\": \"k.ramdass@gdb.gov.gy\",\n  \"reason\": \"Forgot password\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Access history",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.access_history",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "System health",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.system_health",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Integration settings (secrets never returned)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.integration_settings",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Test an integration",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.platform_admin.test_integration",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"group\": \"citizen_eid\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Review — REFUSED for the platform admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.review_loan",
            "description": "403 \"Only GDB underwriters may do this.\" The platform admin decides no credit and moves no money.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{loanName}}\",\n  \"action\": \"approve\"\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Citizen",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Save draft application",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.save_application",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"loan_amount\": 450000,\n  \"purpose\": \"Expand the poultry pens\",\n  \"term_months\": 18,\n  \"monthly_income\": 90000,\n  \"phone\": \"+592-600-1234\",\n  \"business_stage\": \"New\",\n  \"business_name\": \"Kaieteur Poultry\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "A draft is not before the Bank. Copy the returned `name` into the loanName variable, attach documents, then submit."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit application (refused while evidence is missing)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.submit_application",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{loanName}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Names the missing document types rather than simply refusing."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Discard draft",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.discard_application",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{loanName}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Apply for a loan",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.apply_loan",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"loan_amount\": 2500000,\n  \"purpose\": \"Working capital for agro-processing business\",\n  \"term_months\": 36,\n  \"monthly_income\": 450000,\n  \"phone\": \"+592-600-1234\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Save and submit in one call. Documents are optional at submission, so this succeeds with an empty shelf — use the two-phase flow above when the applicant wants to attach evidence first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My loans (history)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.my_loans",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Loan detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.loan_detail",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{loanName}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Loan account (schedule + dues)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.loan_account",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"application\": \"{{loanName}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Returns loan: null until the bank books the loan, and an empty schedule until it is disbursed. Every figure is lending's own."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Make a repayment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.make_repayment",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"application\": \"{{loanName}}\",\n  \"amount\": 38442\n}"
            },
            "description": "Submits a lending Loan Repayment. Needs the loan to be Disbursed, Partially Disbursed or Active. Any cluster member may pay."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Underwriter",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "All loans (queue)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.all_loans",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"Submitted\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Review — approve",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.review_loan",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{loanName}}\",\n  \"action\": \"approve\",\n  \"remarks\": \"Income verified; approved at standard rate.\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Review — reject",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.review_loan",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{loanName}}\",\n  \"action\": \"reject\",\n  \"remarks\": \"Debt-to-income ratio too high.\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Book loan (from an approved application)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.book_loan",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"application\": \"{{loanName}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Creates the Loan via lending's own create_loan mapper and submits it (status Sanctioned). Approving does not book - this is a separate act.\n\nDISBURSEMENT OFFICER ONLY. Signed in as the underwriter this answers \"Only the GDB disbursement officer may do this.\" Sign in as finance@gdb.gov.gy and repeat it to book."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Disburse loan — REFUSED for an underwriter",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.disburse_loan",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"application\": \"{{loanName}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Money movement is the disbursement officer's. Signed in as the underwriter this answers \"Only the GDB disbursement officer may do this.\" Sign in as finance@gdb.gov.gy and repeat it to see the release.\n\nA second gate sits behind the role: disburse_loan also refuses whoever approved the case, so one account holding both roles still cannot decide and pay the same application."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add a condition precedent (after the offer went out)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.conditions.add_condition",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"application\": \"{{loanName}}\",\n  \"description\": \"Site visit to the pens completed.\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Blocks release exactly like a condition from the Letter of Offer."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Record a repayment — REFUSED for staff",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/method/gdb_bank.api.make_repayment",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"application\": \"{{loanName}}\",\n  \"amount\": 25000\n}"
            },
            "description": "The payment box is the borrower's. Bank-side receipts go through collections.apply_receipt, which starts from a Bank Transaction — money that actually arrived."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Documents",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. New shelf row",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
