            "description": "An itemised ask both sides can see. The applicant answers by uploading with `request` set, and it closes itself."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Answer a request (applicant) — step 1",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
